{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I wanted to apologize for yesterday.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:43:29.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870828986933059596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I didn't want you to see me like that, my father gets the better of me, I lose my wits faster than I can contain em.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:44:03.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870829127958163468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"He always knows how to strike where it hurts most.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:44:28.623000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870829234053075034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Fuddles touches his cheek. \"No need to apologize. I want to know every part of you and knowing what you went through with your father is part of that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:46:59.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870829865199349801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"“My father’s immortality, albeit limited, has left him a shell of who he once was. For a time, he was kind, happy even, when my mother was.. still with us.”","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:47:24.120000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870829970140844094","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"“But all that changed,” Cairn looks down. “When she got sick, he set off to find something to help her, at least, that’s what we thought.. he never did return to that shack on the cliffs where she died waiting for a cure that never came… and all the while I was there. Caring for her the only way I could, singing her favorite songs to her and bringing doves, rabbits and veggies to stew for supper.”","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:47:51.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870830083097632799","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"You remind me of her, not in a weird way of course, but you are kind like her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:49:11.144000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870830419032035369","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Fuddles smiles \"I wish I could have met her. I think her and I would have got along. I'm glad she at least had you there to care for her until the end.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:50:38.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870830787153510430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"She'd have loved you thas for damn sure.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:50:58.345000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870830868665622568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"She and my sister...\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:51:08.891000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870830912898727937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"“My sister... You would love her. Wherever she is, in that vast ocean there, I know both she and my mum would have loved you.”","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:51:53.170000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870831098618331186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"We will find her one day. If you think she is alive. I will help you find her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:52:35.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870831277195018272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"“I miss her, but I know we’ll see each other one day. Every year on our birthday I make us a shortcake. Early on, I used to save her half, but after a few years, it became just a slice… What?! I like cake, shut it.” He pats his belly.","created_at":"2021-07-31T00:52:39.130000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870831291388543007","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
